{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/ezgif-6dbda2cfc8daf9.gif?t=1747304222\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the mountain. There are no rules here \u2014 only respect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</i></strong> is a drifting racing game set on the legendary Japanese mountain passes \u2014 the <i>touge</i>. With a retro aesthetic inspired by the '90s and a focus on pure drifting, it\u2019s a love letter to a golden era of street motorsport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/Title-retro.png?t=1747304222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized visuals with a cel-shaded touch, neon lights, sunset mountain landscapes, and menus that feel like they came straight out of a Japanese arcade.<br>Precise physics with accessible controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/Title-Conquer.png?t=1747304222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The drifting system strikes a balance between realism and flow, making touge mastery an art \u2014 not a fight against the controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive a carefully crafted selection of cars inspired by drifting legends. Each one has its own handling and character. No complicated customization \u2014 just you and the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/Title-Synth.png?t=1747304222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The soundtrack pays tribute to the VHS and neon era with a soundtrack that follows every descent like a scene from an anime. <br><strong><i>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</i></strong> isn\u2019t just a racing game. It\u2019s a love letter to drifting, to the mountains, to the night\u2026 and to those impossible dreams that only come alive with the engine redlining.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719540?t=1747304222","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/93e2a8cb4dccc29a99121c658b41c63d047a248f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747304222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/65be5ec0a631e0a75b6bdfd672cdb5b764f8ef4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747304222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/65be5ec0a631e0a75b6bdfd672cdb5b764f8ef4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747304222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/ezgif-6dbda2cfc8daf9.gif?t=1747304222\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the mountain. There are no rules here \u2014 only respect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</i></strong> is a drifting racing game set on the legendary Japanese mountain passes \u2014 the <i>touge</i>. With a retro aesthetic inspired by the '90s and a focus on pure drifting, it\u2019s a love letter to a golden era of street motorsport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/Title-retro.png?t=1747304222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized visuals with a cel-shaded touch, neon lights, sunset mountain landscapes, and menus that feel like they came straight out of a Japanese arcade.<br>Precise physics with accessible controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/Title-Conquer.png?t=1747304222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The drifting system strikes a balance between realism and flow, making touge mastery an art \u2014 not a fight against the controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive a carefully crafted selection of cars inspired by drifting legends. Each one has its own handling and character. No complicated customization \u2014 just you and the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/extras/Title-Synth.png?t=1747304222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The soundtrack pays tribute to the VHS and neon era with a soundtrack that follows every descent like a scene from an anime. <br><strong><i>Total Driftin\u2019: Touge Dreams</i></strong> isn\u2019t just a racing game. It\u2019s a love letter to drifting, to the mountains, to the night\u2026 and to those impossible dreams that only come alive with the engine redlining.</p>","developers":["FAS3 Estudios S.L."],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719540/c2f04380efe6989e65d54d6e712b64bd4858249f/header.jpg?t=1747304222","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[